     A N88                                  DSPATR(ND)
     A                                 13  9'1.  ENTER PO AND RELEASE (RLS) TO'
     A                                 13 43'SEE ALL RECEIVING SLIPS'
     A                                 14 37'OR'
     A                                 15  9'2.  ENTER PO, RELEASE (RLS), AND R-
     A                                      ECEIVER (RS) TO BEGIN BROWSING'
     A                                 17  9'3.  DEPRESS f1 OR f2 OR f4'
     A                                 18 37'OR'
     A                                 19  9'4.  DEPRESS f6 TO SWITCH DATABASE -
     A                                      TO LIVE OR HISTORY'
     A            PO             7A  B  9 30DSPATR(UL)
     A                                      OVRDTA
     A                                      OVRATR
     A  01                                  DSPATR(RI)
     A  01                                  DSPATR(PC)
