     A                                  8 13'PURCHASE ORDER HAS RECEIVERS NUMBE-
     A                                      RED 001 THROUGH'
     A                                 12  5'1.  TO SEE ALL RECEIVERS: DEPRESS'
     A                                 12 39'ENTER (WITH ZEROES IN THE BOX BELO-
     A                                      W)'
     A                                 13 37'OR'
     A                                 14  5'2.  TO BEGIN WITH A SPECIFIC RECEI-
     A                                      VER, ENTER THE RECEIVER NUMBER IN'
     A                                 15  9'THE BOX BELOW AND DEPRESS ENTER.'
